       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.
           TPAYIRPT.
       AUTHOR.
           KURT MOVSESIAN.
      *REMARKS.
      *
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *   T P A Y I R P T    THIS PROGRAMS CREATES 2 REPORTS       *
      *     1) INVOICES PAID BY INVOICE INFORMATION - THESE ARE    *
      *        INVOICES THAT ARE PAID BY INVOICE DATA AND NOT PO   *
      *        DATA.  SINCE THE PO SHOULD BE USED IN ALL CASES     *
      *        WHEN IT IS NOT IT IS BROUGHT TO THE USERS ATTENTION *
      *     2) PREPAYED INVOICES - THESE ARE INVOICES IN WHICH THE *
      *        QUANTITY PAID FOR IS MORE THE THE TOTAL QUANTITY    *
      *        RECEIVED.                                           *
      *     3) INVOICE DIFFERENCES - INVOICES WHERE THE PRICE      *
      *        DIFFERENCE BETWEEN THE INVOICE AND PO PRICE IS      *
      *        ABOVE THE TOLERANCES SET IN THE "PINV" KEY OF       *
      *        MPLTINFO.                                           *
      *     4) INVOICE QTY = ZERO  - INVOICES FOR RECEIVABLE       *
      *        POS WHERE THE QUANTITY IS EQUAL TO ZERO AND         *
      *        THE DOLLAR AMOUNT IS GREATER THAN ZERO.             *
      *                                                            *
      *     THIS PROGRAM RUNS WITHIN THE SAME JOB STREAM AS THE    *
      *     MANIFEST CREATE PROGRAM AND USES 'MANWKFL1' THAT IS    *
      *     GENERATED IN THE MANIFEST CREATE PROGRAM TO KNOW WHICH *
      *     REGISTER TO CHECK TO SEE IF THEY QUALIFY FOR THE       *
      *     ABOVE REPORTS.  THE REPORTS WILL BE GENERATED WHENEVER *
      *     A 'NEW', 'REPR', 'RLSE' IS REQUESTED.  THE REPORTS ARE *
      *     ALSO REPRINTABLE.  THE JOB STREAM NAME THIS PROGRAM    *
      *     IS EXECUTED IN IS THE TEMPORARY JOB STREAM 'BXMANJOB'  *
      *     WHICH IS CREATED BY 'TINVMAN'                          *
      *                                                            *
      *     FILE DEFINITIONS (INPUTS/OUTPUTS)                      *
      *        1) MANWKFL1 - FILE THAT CONTAINS A LIST OF ALL      *
      *                      REGISTER NUMBERS CONTAINED IN THE     *
      *                      MOST RECENT MANIFEST FILE RUN         *
      *                      THIS FILE IS CREATED BY 'TMANCRTE'    *
      *                      WHICH IS RAN JUST BEFORE THIS         *
      *                      PROGRAM.                              *
      *        2) PREPAYFL - TEMPORARY FILE THAT IS USED           *
      *                      INTERNALLY WHICH CONTAINS ALL         *
      *                      REGISTERS THAT HAVE BEEN PREPAYED.    *
      *        3) INVRPTFL - REPORT FILE FOR THE REPORT ENTITLED   *
      *                      'INVOICES PROCESSED BY INVOICE        *
      *                      INFORMATION'.                         *
      *        4) PAYRPTFL - A REPORT FILE FOR THE REPORT ENTITLED *
      *                      'PREPAYED INVOICES'.                  *
      *        5) DIFRPTFL - A REPORT FILE FOR THE REPORT ENTITLED *
      *                      'INVOICE DIFFERENCE'.                 *
      *        5) QTY0RPTFL- A REPORT FILE FOR THE REPORT ENTITLED *
      *                      'ZERO QUANTITY INVOICE'.              *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  APRIL 19, 1996  CA YODER   REQ. #96-021
      *C    ADDED TOTALS AT THE END OF BOTH REPORTS SHOWING INVOICE
      *C    TAX AND ACCRUED TAX TOTALS.
      *C
      *C  JULY 11, 1996   CA YODER
      *C    RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  JUNE 01, 2004   CA YODER   NAPANEE REQUEST
      *C    ADDED NEW REPORT TO SHOW INVOICE ITEMS WHICH DIFFER
      *C    FROM PO ITEM TOTALS.
      *C
      *C  JULY 29, 2004   CA YODER   SOX REQUEST
      *C    ADDED NEW REPORT TO SHOW INVOICE ITEMS FOR ZERO QUANTITY
      *C    FOR RECEIVABLE PURCHASE ORDERS.
      *C


       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT REG-FILE          ASSIGN TO DISK-MANWKFL1.
           SELECT PREPAY-INV-FILE   ASSIGN TO DISK-PREPAYFL.
           SELECT INV-PAY-REPORT    ASSIGN TO  DISK-INVRPTFL.
           SELECT PREPAY-INV-REPORT ASSIGN TO DISK-PAYRPTFL.
           SELECT INV-DIFF-REPORT   ASSIGN TO DISK-DIFRPTFL.
           SELECT QTY0-INV-REPORT   ASSIGN TO DISK-QTY0RPTFL.
           SELECT QTY0-INV-FILE     ASSIGN TO DISK-QTY0FL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DINVRCD-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DPOFREIGHT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2404
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DINVITM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DINVACCT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DVENDOR-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPORECD-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  INV-PAY-REPORT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS INV-PAY-REPORT-RCD.
       01  INV-PAY-REPORT-RCD.
           05  INV-PAY-CTL           PIC 9.
           05  INV-PAY-REPORT-LINE   PIC X(132).

       FD  PREPAY-INV-REPORT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS PREPAY-INV-REPORT-RCD.
       01  PREPAY-INV-REPORT-RCD.
           05  PREPAY-CTL            PIC 9.
           05  PREPAY-REPORT-LINE    PIC X(132).

       FD  INV-DIFF-REPORT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS INV-DIFF-REPORT-RCD.
       01  INV-DIFF-REPORT-RCD.
           05  INV-DIFF-CTL          PIC 9.
           05  INV-DIFF-REPORT-LINE  PIC X(132).

       FD  QTY0-INV-REPORT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS QTY0-INV-REPORT-RCD.
       01  QTY0-INV-REPORT-RCD.
           05  QTY0-INV-CTL          PIC 9.
           05  QTY0-INV-REPORT-LINE  PIC X(132).

       FD  REG-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 5 CHARACTERS.
       01  REG-RCD.
           05  REGISTER-NO           PIC X(5).

       FD  PREPAY-INV-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 5 CHARACTERS.
       01  PREPAY-INV-RCD.
           05  PREPAY-REG-NO         PIC X(5).

       FD  QTY0-INV-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 5 CHARACTERS.
       01  QTY0-INV-RCD.
           05  QTY0-REG-NO           PIC X(5).

       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500   OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  DINVRCD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DINVRCD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS2500   OF MCFLCS2501.

       FD  DPOFREIGHT-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPOFREIGHT-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS2400   OF MCFLCS2404.

       FD  DINVITM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DINVITM-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS2600   OF MCFLCS2601.

       FD  DINVACCT-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DINVACCT-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS2700   OF MCFLCS2701.

       FD  DVENDOR-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDOR-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0700   OF MCFLCS0701.

       FD  DPORECD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPORECD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0900   OF MCFLCS0901.

